  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Moses, Speak unto the priests the sons of Aaron, and say unto them, There shall none be defiled for the dead among his people:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But for his kin, that is near unto him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", for his mother, and for his father, and for his son, and for his daughter, and for his brother,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for his sister a virgin, that is nigh unto him, which hath had no husband; for her may he be defiled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall not defile himself,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a chief man among his people, to profane himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not make baldness upon their head, neither shall they shave off the corner of their beard, nor make any cuttings in their flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall be holy unto their God, and not profane the name of their God: for the offerings of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made by fire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the bread of their God, they do offer: therefore they shall be holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not take a wife",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a whore, or profane; neither shall they take a woman put away from her husband: for he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "holy unto his God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt sanctify him therefore; for he offereth the bread of thy God: he shall be holy unto thee: for I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", which sanctify you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the daughter of any priest, if she profane herself by playing the whore, she profaneth her father: she shall be burnt with fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the high priest among his brethren, upon whose head the anointing oil was poured, and that is consecrated to put on the garments, shall not uncover his head, nor rend his clothes;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither shall he go in to any dead body, nor defile himself for his father, or for his mother;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither shall he go out of the sanctuary, nor profane the sanctuary of his God; for the crown of the anointing oil of his God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon him: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall take a wife in her virginity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A widow, or a divorced woman, or profane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an harlot, these shall he not take: but he shall take a virgin of his own people to wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither shall he profane his seed among his people: for I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do sanctify him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak unto Aaron, saying, Whosoever",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of thy seed in their generations that hath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blemish, let him not approach to offer the bread of his God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whatsoever man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
